-- +goose Up
-- Seed the search-only card index with products from the issuer's public card list that
-- the vetted catalog does not already model. Identity only: no rates, no fee. Products we
-- already model are covered by migration 14, which carries their sourced terms, so this
-- seed omits them to avoid showing the same card twice in search.

